import{_ as i,o as a,c as t,a2 as o}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const g=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 950 | Anti-Predation Heavenly-Dao Rules · Rule 16 | Eradicate Civilizational Regression","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 950 | Anti-Predation Heavenly-Dao Rules · Rule 16 | Eradicate Civilizational Regression","no":950,"module":5,"tags":["Heavenly-Dao Rule","Rule 16","Civilizational Regression","Causal Self-Discipline","Civilizational Finalization"],"related":["04-Anti-Predationism Core Thesis","951-Eradicate Historical Reversal","901-Civilizational Final-Finalization Jurisprudential Basis"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0950_模块5-规则十六-根除文明倒退.md","filePath":"en/0950_模块5-规则十六-根除文明倒退.md"}'),n={name:"en/0950_模块5-规则十六-根除文明倒退.md"};function r(s,e,l,d,u,c){return a(),t("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[o('<h1 id="entry-950-anti-predation-heavenly-dao-rules-·-rule-16-eradicate-civilizational-regression" tabindex="-1">Entry 950 | Anti-Predation Heavenly-Dao Rules · Rule 16 | Eradicate Civilizational Regression <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-950-anti-predation-heavenly-dao-rules-·-rule-16-eradicate-civilizational-regression" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 950 | Anti-Predation Heavenly-Dao Rules · Rule 16 | Eradicate Civilizational Regression&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 5 · Civilization Final-Finalization Canonical Entries | Benchmark base: Document 04 | Series: Complete Collection of Anti-Predation Heavenly-Dao Rules</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-civilization-may-not-regress-from-having-books-back-to-knotted-cords" tabindex="-1">Introduction: civilization may not regress from &quot;having books&quot; back to &quot;knotted cords&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-civilization-may-not-regress-from-having-books-back-to-knotted-cords" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: civilization may not regress from &quot;having books&quot; back to &quot;knotted cords&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Pre-Anchor Era&#39;s most despairing thing was not some individual&#39;s failure, but the whole civilization periodically regressing — just developed to where it could build law ships, a predatory war burned the books, killed off the people, and lost the technology; tens of thousands of years of achievement went to zero overnight, descendants crawling out of caves again. Heavenly-Dao Rule 16 must eradicate this &quot;civilizational-level suicide&quot; at the cosmic-law layer: once the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization reaches some development baseline, any attempt to pull it back to a lower stage is judged by Heavenly-Dao rules as an attack on all Myriad Ranks, not an &quot;internal affair.&quot; This is the causal self-discipline axiom&#39;s projection on civilizational time axis.</p><p>The six top-level axioms here aim at the time dimension: the causal self-discipline axiom directly requires &quot;eradicate civilizational regression&quot;; the republican axiom of Myriad Races decides regression harms all Myriad Ranks&#39; descendants; the anti-predation axiom points out regression&#39;s root is predation; the collective-ascension axiom requires civilization advance not retreat, whole-system lifting; the law-first axiom lets &quot;regression baseline, regression judgment, regression response&quot; be nailed first by law.</p><p>It must further point out the newly added Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing and layabouts retain a floor basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes may superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. This axiom rewrites predation&#39;s meaning at the root: old-cosmos resources and Dao were finite, so predation involution was forced; in Heng Yuan Zhou everyone inherently possesses infinite origin, and predation loses meaning. What this Heavenly-Dao rule establishes is precisely the law guardrail of this new order of &quot;infinite origin, predation meaningless.&quot;</p><h2 id="i-rule-content-three-forms-of-regression-and-their-eradication" tabindex="-1">I. Rule Content: Three Forms of Regression and Their Eradication <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-rule-content-three-forms-of-regression-and-their-eradication" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Rule Content: Three Forms of Regression and Their Eradication&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li><strong>Technological regression</strong>: key methods, technology, and knowledge lost on a large scale immediately triggers &quot;civilizational seed-preservation engineering&quot; — Alaya public-library backups must immediately fully restore to the affected civilization;</li><li><strong>Structural regression</strong>: civilizational governance regresses from republicanism to dictatorship, from openness to closure; the Anchor Council launches charter defense, not recognizing the post-regression pseudo-government;</li><li><strong>Demographic regression</strong>: large-scale being death from predatory war and cyclical harvesting triggers Myriad-Rank relief and causal restoration.</li></ol><p>Eradication is not &quot;post-hoc fire-fighting,&quot; but &quot;pre-event locking&quot;: all civilizational-development achievements have redundant backups in the Alaya Network, and regression attempts are alerted in their bud stage.</p><h2 id="ii-jurisprudential-basis" tabindex="-1">II. Jurisprudential Basis <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-jurisprudential-basis" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Jurisprudential Basis&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Historical-retrospective argument</strong>: Document 04 proves predatory civilizations&#39; endgame is necessarily regression; the symbiotic system is the only stably advancing structure, so eradicating regression = eradicating predatory restoration;</li><li><strong>Irreversible-loss argument</strong>: beings who died in civilizational regression and knowledge lost cannot be resurrected by any cultivation means — this is true irreversibility, so it must be prevented beforehand;</li><li><strong>Descendants&#39;-rights argument</strong>: later Myriad Ranks have the right to stand on predecessors&#39; shoulders; no one has the right to burn predecessors&#39; books.</li></ul><h2 id="iii-execution-mechanism" tabindex="-1">III. Execution Mechanism <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-execution-mechanism" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Execution Mechanism&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>The Alaya Network maintains a &quot;development-baseline dashboard&quot; for each civilization, monitoring its technology, structure, and population three indicators;</li><li>Abnormal indicator decline triggers a &quot;regression warning,&quot; and the Anchor Supervisory Committee dispatches personnel to observe first, then intervene;</li><li>Key development achievements are redundantly backed up across multiple planes and media, preventing single-point destruction from wiping out all;</li><li>Post-regression civilizational recovery takes the &quot;knowledge return&quot; path (Rule 15), with no external trusteeship, letting it rebuild itself.</li></ul><h2 id="iv-consequences-of-violation" tabindex="-1">IV. Consequences of Violation <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-consequences-of-violation" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Consequences of Violation&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Light</strong>: local regression from natural disaster, relief launched, no liability pursued;</li><li><strong>Medium</strong>: regression from man-made policy error, relevant decision-makers suspended, causal retrospective made up;</li><li><strong>Heavy</strong>: deliberately arson-burning books, launching predatory wars, fostering pseudo-governments to regress civilization, is isolated and tried under the Anti-Predation Committee procedure, with no leniency.</li></ul><h2 id="v-supervising-subjects" tabindex="-1">V. Supervising Subjects <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-supervising-subjects" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Supervising Subjects&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision&#39;s development-baseline dashboard is the first layer; the Anchor Supervisory Committee accepts regression warnings as the second layer; the Symbiotic Court adjudicates &quot;deliberate regression&quot; cases as the third layer; Myriad Ranks&#39; descendants&#39; representatives exercise supervision over &quot;protecting predecessors&#39; achievements&quot; as the fourth layer.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: civilizational regression is the cosmos&#39;s greatest repeated waste — tens of thousands of years of achievement going to zero; eradicating it saves immeasurable energy</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: regression&#39;s root is predation; eradicating regression = eradicating predatory restoration; under Axiom 6 everyone inherently possesses basic infinite power, and finite-resource predation loses meaning at the root</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo-type civilizations after the protagonist&#39;s death often rapidly collapse, books gone and people dead; Heng Yuan Zhou development achievements are network-wide backed up and cannot regress</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: the five lineages&#39; civilizations&#39; regression risks are monitored as one, with no relief abandonment because of weakness</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: newly incorporated civilizations automatically enter development-baseline monitoring, expanding with the worldview</li></ul><p>Eradicating civilizational regression must in execution distinguish two kinds of &quot;slow&quot;: one is natural slow determined by internal rhythm, which is healthy; the other is slow suppressed by external force and deliberately maintained by predation remnants, which is the regression precursor. The Alaya Network monitors not &quot;progress not fast enough,&quot; but &quot;whether abnormal decline appears&quot; — lost technological achievements, collapsed governance structure, large-scale being death. Distinguishing &quot;slow&quot; from &quot;regression&quot; is to avoid misjudging easygoing civilizations and civilizations growing at their own rhythm as regression. Under Axiom 6, easygoing ones&#39; slowness is legal; Heavenly-Dao rules only rescue &quot;abnormal decline,&quot; and do not urge &quot;content with the floor.&quot;</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Eradicating civilizational regression is civilizational finalization taking responsibility for &quot;time.&quot; It ensures: from today on, every step Myriad Ranks take counts, and will not be returned to zero by one fire.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/04-反掠夺主义核心论纲.html">Entry 04 · Anti-Predationism Core Thesis</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/901_模块5-总论-文明终极定型法理基础.html">Entry 901 · Civilizational Final-Finalization Jurisprudential Basis</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/949_模块5-规则十五-只回传知识不扰动因果.html">Entry 949 · Rule 15 Knowledge-Return-Only Without Causality Disturbance</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/951_模块5-规则十七-根除历史倒车.html">Entry 951 · Rule 17 Eradicate Historical Reversal</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',24)])])}const m=i(n,[["render",r]]);export{g as __pageData,m as default};
